              <flipboard active-id='4' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='Emergency Department – Live Operations                                                                                                              This dashboard provides an overview of emergency department operations, including total patient visits, average length of stay, admission rate, patient arrivals and acuity distribution.' captured-sheet='Dashboard 1 – Live Operations' id='1' />
                  <story-point caption='Healthcare Capacity and Demand Analysis                                                                                                                  This section examines NHS England&apos;s monthly A&amp;E attendances and emergency admissions to understand healthcare demand trends and support capacity planning.' captured-sheet='NHS HEALTHCARE OPERATIONS &amp; CAPACITY ANALYSIS' id='2' />
                  <story-point caption='Patient Quality and Delay Analysis                                                                                                                                            This dashboard analyses patient length of stay, acuity levels and discharge dispositions to identify potential delays and areas requiring operational attention.' captured-sheet='PATIENT QUALITY &amp; DELAY ANALYSIS' id='3' />
                  <story-point caption='Key Operational Findings' captured-sheet='' id='4' />
                  <story-point caption='Management Recommendations.' captured-sheet='' id='5' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='41691' id='6' story-point-id='4' type-v2='text' w='42080' x='21749' y='40504'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Average ED length of stay: 8.11 hours</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Total ED visits: 222</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Admission rate: 67.57%</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>High acuity rate: 51.80%</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='71810' hidden='true' id='7' story-point-id='5' type-v2='text' w='70134' x='2600' y='22849'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>MANAGEMENT RECOMMENDATIONS</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Based on the analysis of emergency department operations, the following actions are recommended:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>1. Improve Staff Allocation</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>
Align staffing levels with peak patient arrival hours to reduce waiting time.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>2. Prioritise High-Acuity Patients</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>
Ensure patients with higher acuity receive timely medical attention.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>3. Reduce Length of Stay</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>
Monitor patients with prolonged ED stays and identify bottlenecks in the treatment process.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>4. Optimise Bed Capacity</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>
Use NHS England&apos;s historical A&amp;E attendance and admission trends to support capacity planning.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>5. Improve Patient Flow</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>
Review admission and discharge patterns to improve operational efficiency.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Conclusion:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> The proposed Hospital Operations and Patient Flow Command Center provides data-driven insights to support better resource allocation, patient-flow management and healthcare operational decision-making.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{D3E31EA6-E8AB-497E-AC17-CF4AB80E8D96}' />
    </dashboard>
